        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for AppStream",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for AppStream fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-136413: infinite loop via integer wraparound in asc_l10n_parse_data_qt() can lead to denial of service\n  (bsc#1291668).\n- CVE-2026-136414: division-by-zero in asc_read_translation_status() can lead to process crash (bsc#1291669).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
